  "user": "Give me reason code for transaction TX-0401 with amount 240.00 EUR.",
  "answer": "Transaction **TX-0401** is a card payment of **EUR 240.00** to **TechMart Online** on 2026-07-20, status settled.\n\nThe reason code depends on what went wrong, and I can't assign one without knowing that. These are the dispute reason codes available:\n\n- **duplicate_charge**: you were charged more than once for the same purchase.\n- **fraud_card_not_present**: you did not authorise an online card payment.\n- **goods_not_received**: you paid, but the goods were not delivered.\n- **service_not_rendered**: you paid, but the service was not provided.\n- **unauthorized_debit**: the debit was taken from your account without your authorisation.\n\nI noticed that **TX-0402** is also a settled EUR 240.00 card payment to TechMart Online, dated 2026-07-14. If you were charged twice for one purchase, **duplicate_charge** would likely apply.\n\nWhat happened with this payment? Once you tell me, I can check dispute eligibility for TX-0401 before anything is filed. I won't open a dispute without your confirmation.",
